le value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 32% of normal in October to November and 44% in September to October. Grid 12192 had its driest year in 1990 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
